-Chemical abundance analysis of the open clusters Cr 110, NGC 2420, NGC 7789,
-and M 67 (NGC 2682).
-    Pancino E., Carrera R., Rossetti, E., Gallart C.
-   <Astron. Astrophys. 511, A56 (2010)>
-   =2010A&A...511A..56P
