-lp944-20.dat    26      14390    Spectrum for LP944-20
-mucol.dat       23      14390    Atmospheric Spectrum for Mu Columbae
----------------------------------------------------------------------
-
-Byte-by-byte Description of file: vb8.dat, lhs2065.dat
