-Table Operations
-****************
-
-In this section we describe high-level operations that can be used to generate
-a new table from one or more input tables. This includes:
-
-=======================
-
-.. list-table::
-   :header-rows: 1
-   :widths: 28 52 20
-
-   * - Documentation
-     - Description
-     - Function
